dsh-boot-kit
============

This repository contains no third-party code or assets. At install time it
declares or downloads the packages listed below; each keeps its own license.

Third-party components referenced by the installer
--------------------------------------------------

dsh-startup-screen
  MIT · https://github.com/6shenhonghong9/dsh-startup-screen
  Downloaded as a release tarball from GitHub (not redistributed here).

@linxin666/dsh-web-all  (and its 24 transitive @linxin666/* packages)
  Apache-2.0 · https://github.com/zhu1090093659/dsh-web
  Declared as an npm dependency only.

dsh-whale-widget
  MIT · https://github.com/MeteorNOX/DeepSeek-Balance-Whale-Widget
  Declared as an npm dependency only. Disabled by default by this installer.

Skins
  Skins are downloaded by the user from the DSH skin center. This repository
  ships and references NO skin assets. In particular the `whale-fantasy` skin
  is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (non-commercial, share-alike) and must not be mirrored,
  bundled, or redistributed by this project.
